WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:06.416
The audio and video data as well as data
from the sensors are coming in.

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:10.000
The rubble is unstable
and difficult to walk on.

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:14.000
Machinery and parts of the facility
were damaged by the collapse.

00:00:14.041 --> 00:00:18.875
The crater is approximately
300 meters wide and 80 meters deep.

00:00:18.916 --> 00:00:21.500
It appears to be part
of a larger underground cave.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.416
There's a hole at two o'clock
that leads further in.

00:00:25.916 --> 00:00:29.125
Caves of varying sizes
beneath the permafrost…

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:31.166
Were there underground rivers?

00:00:31.666 --> 00:00:33.750
Oh, the dating calculations are in.

00:00:34.375 --> 00:00:36.291
There are almost no traces of Sig ore.

00:00:36.375 --> 00:00:38.291
The cave was formed 20,000 years ago…

00:00:38.791 --> 00:00:40.250
Jim! Rescue kit!

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.500
Learn to multitask, kid.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.000
Second wave! Descend!

00:00:54.791 --> 00:00:56.250
Three, two…

